WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:03.910
Classical education is an approach rooted in Western tradition

1
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:06.610
that focuses on training student thinking

2
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:09.039
rather than solely information absorption,

3
00:00:09.619 --> 00:00:11.050
structured around the trivium,

4
00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:12.630
which in Latin means

5
00:00:12.770 --> 00:00:14.909
the place where three roads meet,

6
00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:17.129
and aligns instruction with a child's

7
00:00:17.129 --> 00:00:20.170
natural cognitive development through three stages.

8
00:00:21.219 --> 00:00:22.940
Grammar K to 4.

9
00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:24.799
Memorization,

10
00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:25.819
vocabulary,

11
00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.459
and foundational facts.

12
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:28.950
Logic,

13
00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:30.629
grades 5 to 8.

14
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:32.919
Cause and effect reasoning,

15
00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:34.240
analytical thinking,

16
00:00:34.369 --> 00:00:35.639
and formal logic.

17
00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:37.110
And

18
00:00:37.889 --> 00:00:38.569
Rhetoric,

19
00:00:38.689 --> 00:00:40.430
grades 9 to 12.

20
00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:42.360
Persuasive expression,

21
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:43.720
original synthesis,

22
00:00:43.849 --> 00:00:44.990
and eloquent debate.

23
00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:48.400
Rather than relying on modern textbooks,

24
00:00:48.729 --> 00:00:51.279
classical learning centers on primary sources,

25
00:00:51.569 --> 00:00:52.240
great books,

26
00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:53.009
Latin,

27
00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.669
and chronological history.

28
00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:56.479
It integrates literature,

29
00:00:56.689 --> 00:00:57.150
science,

30
00:00:57.209 --> 00:01:00.069
and historical context into one narrative.

31
00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.159
Ultimately,

32
00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.330
classical education aims to cultivate wisdom,

33
00:01:04.529 --> 00:01:05.849
intellectual discipline,

34
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:10.529
and moral virtue by guiding students toward the enduring ideals of truth,

35
00:01:10.889 --> 00:01:11.430
goodness,

36
00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:12.209
and beauty.

37
00:01:13.019 --> 00:01:16.889
While some current homeschool approaches to classical education are Christian,

38
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:20.779
classical education itself is based in secular roots.